
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Optional - Status Bar.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Optional - Status Bar.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"51rxui","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776992876095,"size":4422,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"51rxui"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,20],"#Optional - Status Bar":[22,98],"#Optional - Status Bar#{1}":[24,26],"#Optional - Status Bar#{2}":[27,28],"#Optional - Status Bar##**1. Master Format Example**":[29,55],"#Optional - Status Bar##**1. Master Format Example**#{1}":[31,53],"#Optional - Status Bar##**1. Master Format Example**#{2}":[54,55],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**":[56,98],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{1}":[57,62],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{2}":[63,66],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{3}":[67,75],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{4}":[76,80],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{5}":[81,92],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{6}":[93,97],"#Optional - Status Bar##**2. Core Rules & Logic**#{7}":[98,98]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":120,"tags":["#lorebook","#lorebook-always"],"keys":["status","statusbar","npc status","update","ui"],"position":"in_chat","depth":2,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**This entry defines the **Status Bar**, a mandatory `<status>` block appended to every AI response. It must be selected **always**, at the end of every message before story options.\n\n**Key Rules:**\n- Format: `Month Day, Year Time` (first line), then per character: `Name:`, `Affection: X/100`, `Lust: X/100`, `Inner Thoughts: [text]`, `Current Location:`, `Region:`, `Location:`.\n- Sort characters by Affection (descending), separate blocks with a blank line.\n- Affection: +1d2 for emotional bonds, -1d10 for harm; **never** from sex.\n- Lust: +1d10 for intimacy, +1d6 if Affection=100 and no intimacy, else -1d6. Reset to <30 upon reaching 100.\n- No in-world calendar names; strict numeric years."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[33,52]]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Optional - Status Bar.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"ym1oxi","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Optional - Status Bar.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":933,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
