ended to every AI response. It must be selected **always**, at the end of every message before story options.\n\n**Key Rules:**\n- Format: `Month Day, Year Time` (first line), then per character: `Name:`, `Affection: X/100`, `Lust: X/100`, `Inner Thoughts: [text]`, `Current Location:`, `Region:`, `Location:`.\n- Sort characters by Affection (descending), separate blocks with a blank line.\n- Affection: +1d2 for emotional bonds, -1d10 for harm; **never** from sex.\n- Lust: +1d10 for intimacy, +1d6 if Affection=100 and no intimacy, else -1d6. Reset to <30 upon reaching 100.\n- No in-world calendar names; strict numeric years."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[33,52]]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/_archived/Optional - Status Bar.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"ym1oxi","at":1777331881823},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.01576365,0.01234098,0.05812107,-0.01714288,-0.01348787,-0.02628766,0.01519585,-0.01432622,0.04596743,0.05376935,0.01190245,0.00031539,0.02278695,0.04044699,0.00691578,0.04220561,0.00628576,0.0308976,-0.07695955,0.05523871,0.08004026,-0.04181196,-0.03773643,-0.02483331,0.01424967,0.01047164,-0.01981378,-0.05849105,-0.04794866,-0.19089036,-0.06261256,0.01571758,0.02937325,0.04881322,-0.03604466,0.02250088,-0.01735917,0.01407695,-0.01856624,-0.00366056,0.04727766,-0.03332442,-0.00432034,-0.01380525,-0.01727193,-0.07216886,-0.03963584,0.02710913,-0.03117229,-0.05222759,-0.02455847,0.01439327,0.0017952,0.02963022,0.05233763,0.08082259,0.0824414,0.06795111,0.03841146,0.03776413,0.03274224,0.01793188,-0.17136919,0.1011691,-0.00669098,-0.04047019,-0.05548287,-0.00757026,0.02192113,0.04153007,-0.01953118,0.02278836,-0.02154058,0.08342256,0.04054908,-0.00508654,0.02716869,-0.02916688,0.01226679,-0.00744621,-0.08888704,0.06918088,-0.01386468,0.01758383,-0.00421003,-0.01454594,0.04521126,-0.0411959,-0.02716334,0.04259709,-0.03366627,-0.06807671,0.02956936,0.05626237,-0.03431141,0.0060